This project is a modified version of Chat 2 (ChatTwo).

Original work: Anna (ascclemens) and Infi (Infiziert90)
Upstream: https://github.com/Infiziert90/ChatTwo
Licence: European Union Public Licence, version 1.2 (EUPL-1.2). The full text is in LICENCE.

Modification date: 2026-11-03
Modification: Chat 2 Vanilla (assembly and internal name ChatTwoVanilla). The chat log can be drawn with the game's own UI textures, Axis font, channel colours, and log transparency, while the original Chat 2 look remains available. Commands, ImGui window ids, and IPC channels are renamed so this plugin can load beside Chat 2.

The original source was imported with its git history. Commits after that import are the fork.
